⚡️ В МИД РФ заявили, что выступление Путина на пленарном заседании ВЭФ мощно отзовётся за рубежом

Официальный представитель ведомства подчеркнула, что речь президента получит широкий резонанс далеко за пределами России.

@News_See

❗️ The Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continue to launch group strikes against logistics centres, ships, port and energy infrastructure of Ukraine operating in the interests of the Armed Forces of Ukraine.

💥 During the night, high-precision air-based weapons and attack drones hit:

📍 in Kiev region:

▫️ in Gatnoye, Eko-Avtotekniks logistics centre, where dual-purpose goods were stored and distributed;

📍 in Odessa region:

▫️ in the port of Yuzhny, a dry cargo ship with military equipment;

▫️ in the port of Chernomorsk, a dry cargo ship with Western-made weapons, a depot with military hardware, and a fuel pumping terminal, used by the Armed Forces of Ukraine;

▫️ in Mirnoye, the Novoodesskaya electrical substation.

🔹Russian Defence Ministry
